LUT-AD repository — license notice
==================================

This repository contains code released under multiple licenses. Each
component carries its own LICENSE file; the table below summarises which
license applies where, and files inherit from the closest LICENSE on the
path from the file to the repository root.

  Path                          | License        | Full text
  ------------------------------|----------------|-----------------------------
  Depth-Normal_Rendering/       | Apache-2.0     | Depth-Normal_Rendering/LICENSE
  YOLO-WT/                      | AGPL-3.0       | YOLO-WT/LICENSE
  paper/                        | CC BY-NC 4.0   | (see manuscript copyright)
  Crop_Data/, Train_Data/       | CC BY-NC 4.0   | docs/dataset_card.md

Components in `YOLO-WT/` build on top of Ultralytics
(https://github.com/ultralytics/ultralytics), which is itself AGPL-3.0,
and the licence is therefore inherited by all derivative scripts in
this directory (train.py, val.py, detect.py, patch_ckpt_names.py, the
custom modules under ultralytics/nn/AddModules/, and the YAMLs under
ultralytics/cfg/).

The C++ renderer in `Depth-Normal_Rendering/` is independent of
Ultralytics and is released under Apache-2.0 by the authors.

For citation, see README.md.
